ework@gmail.com","name":"Max"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:13:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(builder-rsbuild): headless change-detection adapter for storybook tools (#548)\n\n- port builder-vite''s headless change-detection adapter from\n  storybookjs/storybook e69ea8b (unchanged through the v10.6.0 end state):\n  changeDetectionAdapter(options) returns a headless adapter when no dev\n  server compiler exists, reading resolve config from a development-mode\n  compiler that is created and closed without a server\n- add the builder-vite-style preset entry (src/preset.ts -> dist/preset.js,\n  plus a root preset.js): headless loadStorybook loads\n  <builder dir>/preset.js instead of corePresets, so without it\n  previewMainTemplate is missing; src/preview-preset.ts, corePresets and\n  the ./presets/preview-preset export are unchanged\n- keep one real-Rspack test for the headless adapter; mirror tests removed","tree":{"sha":"694bb2e5e75a49147204542848cd21e3934fd79b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/git/trees/694bb2e5e75a49147204542848cd21e3934fd79b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/git/commits/d3e5542357e6175b3bb63f494e31682933f85662","verification":{"payload":"tree 694bb2e5e75a49147204542848cd21e3934fd79b\nparent 6f612a819e811f90d143fbd2a7b62f1f8aa51c77\nauthor Max <fi3ework@gmail.com> 1789722838 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789722838 +0000\n\nfeat(builder-rsbuild): headless change-detection adapter for storybook tools (#548)\n\n- port builder-vite''s headless change-detection adapter from\n  storybookjs/storybook e69ea8b (unchanged through the v10.6.0 end state):\n  changeDetectionAdapter(options) returns a headless adapter when no dev\n  server compiler exists, reading resolve config from a development-mode\n  compiler that is created and closed without a server\n- add the builder-vite-style preset entry (src/preset.ts -> dist/preset.js,\n  plus a root preset.js): headless loadStorybook loads\n  <builder dir>/preset.js instead of corePresets, so without it\n  previewMainTemplate is missing; src/preview-preset.ts, corePresets and\n  the ./presets/preview-preset export are unchanged\n- keep one real-Rspack test for the headless adapter; mirror tests removed","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrQDWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlVAQAFYrlmQTSTUVvfSvyyRvBuWE\nWcN5yUlgHBSXDjJP59zrjVG+Ovh7nu5XwsvM7DncPfXQozDDQWo8NCV58EkX+7wo\nHW4vgYpoKrMlQZDM6cuNpotaWwL3/KvqrVW2h9aeBfFGxesMGJ04wX2rulz09v63\n5ioKisXp/g/bYKfgC5aDKzWry/VZpiTKwBK/m7TRlmBwOkTts23wXqVBWpuWUsFY\nGfly7ezIdd31/OfDRpngMKyD9agUhQvTeZKWBgrei51UBxFeu7KjAidcoQPkM3rH\nTctCKAXFj4xgwEgREhOdzfOvykVnYQOK4qz6xIR1FdrGBLBCgDzugiH4+//CVuDW\nuMJHqm1vu7DejKeqHL6rKk9n/skb+xSJWfRP3H7Qw1ttHVVNGR0GP0y8PtH1DbUC\n/y1Sf74xa4IY4+0NUkCb3wOycidySZ9e/Pg5xhHj05+LyyQesrsqeNnEA2eX73hb\naQBjeSN+Sp2t1dS4imdo17BPkXUKmC+IecSgZ9Y9yo+rco0D6xpgbvNpYYljf9rP\n4qZABBiUdp4fKy05I7+x7zRWGYuAmbAYEiuOOk8LGAxLXByuZqtX7ButfoU85RFK\nj904MHrGn0S1osWONRdb0gDhwWxklnbxR4sb2U6sDczRwaS6jR0NQqqiRzy7raAf\nA9w3OJhvhMh8j2d9nRLQ\n=4vsp\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T09:13:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/sta