,"name":"Max"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T13:45:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(ci): slim test matrix, parallelize lint, drop Playwright install (#564)\n\n* chore(ci): slim test matrix, parallelize lint, drop Playwright install\n\n- Reduce test-build from a 6-job node x OS product to 3 explicit\n  combos: ubuntu/node 22, macos/node 26, windows/node 26.\n- Run lint-check in parallel with test-build; merge gating is\n  unchanged via the ci-passed aggregator.\n- Run e2e on the runner''s pre-installed Chrome (channel: ''chrome'' on\n  CI) and delete the Playwright browser install/cache steps, saving\n  ~2 min of apt deps per Linux run.\n- Bump pkg.pr.new to Node 26; sync docs/git-workflow.md with the\n  removed lint needs-gate.\n\n* chore(deps): drop tsx in favor of jiti\n\ntsx''s tsImport appends ?tsx-namespace to node: builtins, which Rstest''s\nmodule runner treats as file paths — broken on Node 26 even at the\npinned 4.23.0. Load presets in tests via jiti (already a devDependency,\nand what Storybook upstream uses), run check-dependency-version through\nthe jiti CLI, and remove the now-unneeded tsx hold from renovate.","tree":{"sha":"509f70cd874f3952b71689b98d3b463ca0a0e52f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/git/trees/509f70cd874f3952b71689b98d3b463ca0a0e52f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/git/commits/8fcc2318edbf671bf072d46a04b285f5d45ef086","verification":{"payload":"tree 509f70cd874f3952b71689b98d3b463ca0a0e52f\nparent 392efa3a1ecd7864109e19ad764479ac069a8207\nauthor Max <fi3ework@gmail.com> 1787838353 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787838353 +0000\n\nchore(ci): slim test matrix, parallelize lint, drop Playwright install (#564)\n\n* chore(ci): slim test matrix, parallelize lint, drop Playwright install\n\n- Reduce test-build from a 6-job node x OS product to 3 explicit\n  combos: ubuntu/node 22, macos/node 26, windows/node 26.\n- Run lint-check in parallel with test-build; merge gating is\n  unchanged via the ci-passed aggregator.\n- Run e2e on the runner''s pre-installed Chrome (channel: ''chrome'' on\n  CI) and delete the Playwright browser install/cache steps, saving\n  ~2 min of apt deps per Linux run.\n- Bump pkg.pr.new to Node 26; sync docs/git-workflow.md with the\n  removed lint needs-gate.\n\n* chore(deps): drop tsx in favor of jiti\n\ntsx''s tsImport appends ?tsx-namespace to node: builtins, which Rstest''s\nmodule runner treats as file paths — broken on Node 26 even at the\npinned 4.23.0. Load presets in tests via jiti (already a devDependency,\nand what Storybook upstream uses), run check-dependency-version through\nthe jiti CLI, and remove the now-unneeded tsx hold from renovate.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkD+RCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9SMQAJLDq1YSutBhxyWqNJ5rRM9R\nbth02+Ohmirp2NLnm+zzQIIlRxrnIzWvR62SpTILQhcyuA7ggp8Aj/i5Vu28PrPX\n6JxsPJ4eNZF15uPIQA2GzEWlZXomC1gcJ2vRCaVS/Jhyb1dE3UHZbgduocOmcCt/\nQGUldc9wlpnFaWnzPoeCx6xP2XPoiePHZ7H0KpBpUu/WmRICLjK+8Qq/uI4/W+Sc\nEJRVhbQCH0YRtA9mMXPwnxW1jVBzHwZVfsCzJ80HXTwi9mKfdSlyrJfopSaJiJVI\nFQ0ofGw9CQ3QT7CHzwRAN5xatwvyZY4pXXfTsb4CryMWrmGFt6aW5pY93cFNGV34\nlzcMDZQYeO4/RJyRP1JDrSDO9NNg4tRvuaS9Yh7QeoKCjTsxdQ6N2POEx5atGO9C\naX4zkMXJqo1LafyxEa3tByq6VdS+V64mJk5h7ODn5wtlUXc0YSLyjM/BNArSYxk5\nx1H1oC+KTsxb96ViL8NgJVFCFgM8Y55zabgYSrtIPgpFLgpPlTNYL5K8GCyS1VTl\nnXCvh3RS2as/EH9XhGi7QpwpxcERsb++3yRfpCiVUt30knx1rXrO1BdcxEHjEl5I\n9ZnftoI9vS+RSy1nFwU/FQy6N0d7vD7o0RToq/rE8so8odE01ufXdMfo/pFKTNrK\nHBVuwIhCww7xZBN6ywWM\n=7gBy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-27T13:45:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https:/