tps://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/commits/4d3d92c8b20e3bce1db9cc12933d3714f2fe5aab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T09:40:17Z","email":"fi3ework@gmail.com","name":"Max"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T09:40:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: restructure agent guides with progressive disclosure (#561)\n\n* test: move package unit tests into package-level tests directories\n\nUnit tests move out of src/ (and __tests__/) into each package''s tests/\ndirectory, mirroring the src/ structure. Package tsconfigs include tests/\nso pnpm check type-checks them — which is the entire assertion for the\ntypes.test.ts suites. The ported react-docgen-typescript __tests__ suite\nstays in its upstream layout.\n\n* docs: restructure agent guides with progressive disclosure\n\nRoot AGENTS.md keeps only always-on rules and routes task-shaped\ntriggers to topic guides under docs/. Guides carry the verified\nrepo conventions: generated exports maps, the ported-file manifest,\ntest/sandbox/e2e gotchas, CI gating, dependency-range policy, and\nthe release pipeline. CONTRIBUTING''s release steps align with the\nactual bump workflow.\n\n* docs: state the full esbuild external list for dependency edits","tree":{"sha":"753d20843dd46185132a31ab8f50565283794387","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/git/trees/753d20843dd46185132a31ab8f50565283794387"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/git/commits/4d3d92c8b20e3bc