","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/commit/9108e6087c667b15a89cda19025713af1e14b9ab","node_id":"C_kwDOL8RLndoAKDkxMDhlNjA4N2M2NjdiMTVhODljZGExOTAyNTcxM2FmMWUxNGI5YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/commit/91ac7dd0aa69afb9e4a8a62d28a6220d51cd02e6","sha":"91ac7dd0aa69afb9e4a8a62d28a6220d51cd02e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/commits/91ac7dd0aa69afb9e4a8a62d28a6220d51cd02e6"}],"sha":"9108e6087c667b15a89cda19025713af1e14b9ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/commits/9108e6087c667b15a89cda19025713af1e14b9ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12322740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fi3ework","id":12322740,"login":"fi3ework","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMzIyNzQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/commits/91ac7dd0aa69afb9e4a8a62d28a6220d51cd02e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T07:03:31Z","email":"fi3ework@gmail.com","name":"Max"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T07:03:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(builder-rsbuild): flatten preview output so relative asset URLs resolve (#522) (#523)\n\n`output.assetPrefix` has been `''''` since v3.3.3 (#464, closing #224) while\nRsbuild''s nested `distPath` defaults were left in place. With a relative\nassetPrefix every loading context resolves asset URLs against its own\nlocation, not against the document:\n\n  - DOM-injected <script> / <img src>  -> document.baseURI  (always the root)\n  - importScripts inside a worker      -> the worker script''s own URL\n  - url() inside a stylesheet          -> the CSS file''s own URL\n\nSo a worker emitted at static/js/ asking for static/js/async/<id>.js\nrequested static/js/static/js/async/<id>.js, and CSS at static/css/ could\nnot reach static/media/. Flattening all ten nesting `distPath` keys puts\nevery relative-resolving file at the dist root, which is exactly what the\nofficial @storybook/builder-webpack5 does. `templates/preview.ejs` is\nunchanged.","tree":{"sha":"7201bda83e9c71b6e4273394f9836b6241ef5d00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/git/trees/7201bda83e9c71b6e4273394f9836b6241ef5d00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/git/commits/91ac7dd0aa69afb9e4a8a62d28a6220d51cd02e6","verification":{"payload":"tree 7201bda83e9c71b6e4273394f9836b6241ef5d00\nparent 1891ed28729e0b4a3a3afbc1d2bfabfdfd72e061\nauthor Max <fi3ework@gmail.com> 1785481411 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785481411 +0800\n\nfix(builder-rsbuild): flatten preview output so relative asset URLs resolve (#522) (#523)\n\n`output.assetPrefix` has been `''''` since v3.3.3 (#464, closing #224) while\nRsbuild''s nested `distPath` defaults were left in place. With a relative\nassetPrefix every loading context resolves asset URLs against its own\nlocation, not against the document:\n\n  - DOM-injected <script> / <img src>  -> document.baseURI  (always the root)\n  - importScripts inside a worker      -> the worker script''s own URL\n  - url() inside a stylesheet          -> the CSS file''s own URL\n\nSo a worker emitted at static/js/ asking for static/js/async/<id>.js\nrequested static/js/static/js/async/<id>.js, and CSS at static/css/ could\nnot reach static/media/. Flattening all ten nesting `distPath` keys puts\nevery relative-resolving file at the dist root, which is exactly what the\nofficial @storybook/builder-webpack5 does. `templates/preview.ejs` is\nunchanged.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqbEjDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApqYQAFw8dFdYAzueluggTAsNc1BF\nW519Wt9D5SvuoNo8FoWvGjjClmi4AMpXCOvYEd1ZCk15J14MjY9kjODcAKfCukr2\n3gOS5Q5pSnnrUq83N7VHzQ9KcBdj6q1XuMiAmBtc2vBALem9unNBlU07HEajvqzT\nmfxtjo61lSTZ20XH0gYh4U5759wWvhrT25h4KG/eWF9yi2vhn3mCPiRMJ1FyxQSk\njW53bz0k7Auucgj7kcIH71oSTwLtkvMcJvhGB0txuGNT6RMPrURIs/dU1DZvFuod\nJZnbgifGKSm8T0pchOOVP6itT0q8q38ey+lDMwkKRfUHaj0tFL47MLe9kao9KSlZ\nj4IzHNKADBruBYXPGWib9wELCcpQpLCMw2L0LqBk908Mmx5RjPJLO81A+RaN1urP\nZ68X8/Z3DMeZ8oBO7oX3v0BZHPqQAiBdDcuTSKjdFpQlwctxKbMMqbtVdcK4HTMa\nQ6+eAML5jRt+BfRFfllrYNybuUJRJDqIbcCrOmpflWDAgzEaI68z5IN7wGpvB/KR\nLu6Y1nElvht8Isa16khzf+myYCPLSEMX4MNGhwienA5bcUiTqhv/l6JzFWAlioCy\nyf5KYS/8HZJQVEa0fuyHWJgX6ba2iQlsIR7czr3EqS+3NAZFoNLyM61RvSXSaf/x\n/Cqr73kHAGIsQj5OaV31\n=Be3j\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-31T07:03:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/commit/91ac7dd0aa69afb9e4a8a62d28a6220d51cd02e6","node_id":"C_kwDOL8RLndoAKDkxYWM3ZGQwYWE2OWFmYjllNGE4YTYyZDI4YTYyMjBkNTFjZDAyZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/commit/1891ed28729e0b4a3a3afbc1d2bfabfdfd72e061","sha":"1891ed28729e0b4a3a3afbc1d2bfabfdfd72e061","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/commits/1891ed28729e0b4a3a3afbc1d2bfabfdfd72e061"}],"sha":"91ac7dd0aa69afb9e4a8a62d28a6220d51cd02e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/commits/91ac7dd0aa69afb9e4a8a62d28a6220d51cd02e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/2740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/renovate","id":29139614,"login":"renovate[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90MjkxMzk2MTQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/renovate%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"http