":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: sync upstream storybook changes (#516) (#517)\n\n* fix(builder-rsbuild): drop redundant __STORYBOOK_ADDONS_CHANNEL__ assignment\n\nstorybook@10.5.0''s addons.setChannel(channel) installs the channel into\nglobalThis.__STORYBOOK_ADDONS_CHANNEL__ internally via the channel-slot\nrefactor, so the manual assignment in the modern entry template is\nredundant. Mirrors upstream storybookjs/storybook a3ba897.\n\nRefs #516\n\n* docs(sandboxes): fix stale arg-types doc URL in story templates\n\nstorybook.js.org/docs/api/argtypes now 404s; the canonical path is\ndocs/api/arg-types. Mirrors upstream storybookjs/storybook 2f9421d.\n\nRefs #516\n\n* feat(framework-react): skip build-time docgen when docgen service is on\n\nWhen experimentalDocgenServer is enabled, the docs blocks consume React\nmetadata from the core/docgen open-service, so injecting __docgenInfo into\nthe preview bundle would duplicate/conflict with it. Short-circuit\nrsbuildFinalDocs in that mode, matching upstream storybookjs/storybook\n6e4e579 (react-vite + react-webpack).\n\nRefs #516","tree":{"sha":"4922cc42a9852af438335caf6a4eee1d0339fe5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/git/trees/4922cc42a9852af438335caf6a4eee1d0339fe5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/git/commits/e01961ab940b38173532f25d22236b993d3364cd","verification":{"payload":"tree 4922cc42a9852af438335caf6a4eee1d0339fe5b\nparent 90f5aea86b12ff3126e8fd47aee2584758b2652e\nauthor Max <fi3ework@gmail.com> 1783933213 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783933213 +0800\n\nchore: sync upstream storybook changes (#516) (#517)\n\n* fix(builder-rsbuild): drop redundant __STORYBOOK_ADDONS_CHANNEL__ assignment\n\nstorybook@10.5.0''s addons.setChannel(channel) installs the channel into\nglobalThis.__STORYBOOK_ADDONS_CHANNEL__ internally via the channel-slot\nrefactor, so the manual assignment in the modern entry template is\nredundant. Mirrors upstream storybookjs/storybook a3ba897.\n\nRefs #516\n\n* docs(sandboxes): fix stale arg-types doc URL in story templates\n\nstorybook.js.org/docs/api/argtypes now 404s; the canonical path is\ndocs/api/arg-types. Mirrors upstream storybookjs/storybook 2f9421d.\n\nRefs #516\n\n* feat(framework-react): skip build-time docgen when docgen service is on\n\nWhen experimentalDocgenServer is enabled, the docs blocks consume React\nmetadata from the core/docgen open-service, so injecting __docgenInfo into\nthe preview bundle would duplicate/conflict with it. Short-circuit\nrsbuildFinalDocs in that mode, matching upstream storybookjs/storybook\n6e4e579 (react-vite + react-webpack).\n\nRefs #516","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVKkdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMwkQAKxG9WKMkZsbSgdJkckkDCqW\ncIRSUgtgVC9KwGTeTEM2lbkg0cyHW9Ha/RVGVPj1rn4fl5ZQrEd4VNSE7CTyWksK\nrWuoYnXVo088vNC6wOE11qPA+dk/TO5UohEc6Mm6yiU3LZEAy/qNHN9U7wjyJMrc\n7VEMyxm6lfu4D/+80nopqfMCGgxIxijASSWdzf+UYsrFV8jVsQ5roSaXhwryhyUg\nPXgRa5uheeDgLVgOjoSJ3mn5K/vkKHjDha6SyYV3y05c+VbTjdEyhSOJjYDVnCuE\nJoPUTBbS3rKtwon8aAa9sh0bSrXsHsvBeh30oVwk9AO5N2QpQAgceckBGfDhg6sr\nX3i6QJtzXHtKaibd3l1z0QdU18GIiiSiRqK2vpky5NJoT7vri6cY3wJoEQKaItKo\nyh4F+OfikTRQwvDNcl5Rr3XmzeXRxNI1q+wB9ZEIEPT67MWYEleKo/ut9lIxa4Be\nTrmrIiQfkaRDQD7sOEQa6y4aMrXaUYZcNPxNL0kf4hOL5D79oIGuZXA+QXY4eWWm\nDN0fbRUsE1avr78OQjrJHNMIOh2499iiPtR6SSrPY9gE1ILQHazzoa5WtsAxEO/x\nvUuekUFtlDfdfmE5nlHDOsDB4J9bE9HlXIOK0okvs4Dp30USaf6pSjujINGCZ5qR\nH65FlQfwsJLc0M1tdCu4\n=iWH7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-13T09:00:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/commit/e01961ab940b38173532f25d22236b993d3364cd","node_id":"C_kwDOL8RLndoAKGUwMTk2MWFiOTQwYjM4MTczNTMyZjI1ZDIyMjM2Yjk5M2QzMzY0Y2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/commit/90f5aea86b12ff3126e8fd47aee2584758b2652e","sha":"90f5aea86b12ff3126e8fd47aee2584758b2652e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/commits/90f5aea86b12ff3126e8fd47aee2584758b2652e"}],"sha":"e01961ab940b38173532f25d22236b993d3364cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/commits/e01961ab940b38173532f25d22236b993d3364cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12322740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fi3ework","id":12322740,"login":"fi3ework","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMzIyNzQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fi3ework","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/commits/90f5aea86b12ff3126e8fd47aee2584758b2652e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T08:07:11Z","email":"fi3ework@gmail.com","name":"Max"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T08:07:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(builder-rsbuild): implement change detection adapter (#515)\n\nStorybook 10.5 introduced an optional `changeDetectionAdapter()` method on\nthe `Builder` interface. Core calls it via `previewBuilder.changeDetectionAdapter?.()`\nand, when a builder does not provide one, marks change detection as\n\"unavailable\". This wires up an Rspack-based adapter so the feature works\nwith builder-rsbuild.\n\nPorted from Storybook''s builder-webpack5 adapter (commits 3f12c4e and\need530c), swapping the compiler reference to the Rspack compiler exposed by\nRsbuild''s `onAfterCreateCompiler` hook. Alias normalisation is rewritten for\nRspack''s object-only `ResolveAlias` shape (values may include `false`). The\nfirst-run correctness fix from upstream is preserved: on the first watchRun\nexisting files are classified as `change`, not `add`.\n\nCloses #497","tree":{"sha":"27c2d2d2f6301546ad815d9ed088ba418f2bf0fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/git/trees/27c2d2d2f6301546ad815d9ed088ba418f2bf0fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rstackjs/storybook-rsbuild/git/commits/90f5aea86b12ff3126e8fd47aee2584758b2652e","verification":{"payload":"tree 27c2d2d2f6301546ad815d9ed088ba418f2bf0fb\nparent 221f6b41ee12ffc6e425e7d9fbd69e7cd91ec9c5\nauthor Max <fi3ework@gmail.com> 1783930031 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783930031 +0800\n\nfeat(builder-rsbuild): implement change detection adapter (#515)\n\nStorybook 10.5 introduced an optional `changeDetectionAdapter()` method on\nthe `Builder` interface. Core calls it via `previewBuilder.changeDetectionAdapter?.()`\nand, when a builder does not provide one, marks change detection as\n\"unavailable\". This wires up an Rspack-based adapter so the feature works\nwith builder-rsbuild.\n\nPorted from Storybook''s builder-webpack5 adapter (commits 3f12c4e and\need530c), swapping the compiler reference to the Rspack compiler exposed by\nRsbuild''s `onAfterCreateCompiler` hook. Alias normalisation is rewritten for\nRspack''s object-only `ResolveAlias` shape (values may include `false`). The\nfirst-run correctness fix from upstream is preserved: on the first watchRun\nexisting files are classified as `change`, not `add`.\n\nCloses #497","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVJyvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvA0QAD5jaMDrFnd4dUV524vh59Pb\nJOP+TWbHu1sM8K6MFp0lYDbnd2DbrD+jRW721NtJru2CrI3R9cETXQBvwm0Ek+tF\nN4WRvY8DFdImQoZ2XTFd9ADDo4sfeG1hlWZlIDmhEfxKzrVX3gWZfwSG5zntNcwH\nYyYqp/7PbuEtqvrj/t5V/394sN4LLCpaLIzdHP90AE1w6AfsZseZe/R/rdVaEleE\nNxwZ10pSEUfQB2uZ+wyk1rZJXxu9P1D/WUCW2SGc2nCkR8GmHtr2WON00xYjGG0w\nNXIMUFpct4g7XxuUPmHqMSwDdf47NNIq16PGV5L+Y+X42JLOHUuith1jVeIK6IbE\n94NlNzq42i73Y5X6mJKCIu5ZH++SGWd+njJMxNvLYFc2ovSprE/Uyva3pU7DRhPG\nvTku8Otqj7AiSvrFjGiOY2HyStDriGJhLF3z9Aw3LiSemua4xLKQ7FhH0o4sq8Gz\nnA16FHOAE0PjWMXD7aXLOCGJCX49MnRa+4wynBD5Ayd6VeHgGDEMj7K/BROCG+fs\nBUG6Ci2s/8gBwR9W2/H98tSviEac4hiiwLypDP/HJciPUbhOdjZaTOvSQN3UeTFn\n6caj24GotmlO1dwortSp4+zWrbbj04HU7DqR4p7uM3DmZYzmT62YyNLKQyALhY5/\nFDlOm1AnRiXAXMJ/EOOt\n=ktvg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-13T08:07:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html