.\n- Added `validateRedirect` function to ensure safe post-login redirects.\n- Developed `validatePackageName` function to validate npm package names.\n- Introduced toast notifications with `ToastContainer` and `toastSlice` for user feedback.\n- Updated `Login` and `NewUser` components to handle errors and loading states.\n- Enhanced API error handling in `appApi` and `userApi`.\n- Refactored CSRF token handling in fetch requests.\n- Created unit tests for `useAuth`, `validatePackageName`, and `validateRedirect`.\n- Updated dynamic backend and reverb configuration to support environment variables.\n- Removed localStorage dependencies for user and token state management.","tree":{"sha":"5be27f205cfafc4b072620800a8212a7e492780b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarion-app/frontend/git/trees/5be27f205cfafc4b072620800a8212a7e492780b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/clarion-app/frontend/git/commits/f7c0d90327bd50176831947ad992b38b198bf070","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13080528?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timschwartz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timschwartz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timschwartz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timschwartz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/timschwartz","id":13080528,"login":"timschwartz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDgwNTI4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timschwartz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timschwartz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timschwartz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timschwartz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timschwartz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/