her_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gkrajniak","id":7794387,"login":"gkrajniak","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTQzODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-server-lib/commits/15a0c5e03a33384dd6fcb21816f68aff1aa2a999/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T08:57:25Z","email":"gkrajniak@gmail.com","name":"Grzegorz Krajniak"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T08:57:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): resolve npm audit and Dependabot vulnerabilities (#378)\n\n## Summary\n\nResolves the fixable `npm audit` findings and Dependabot alerts.\n\n## Lockfile updates (`npm audit fix`)\n\n- axios 1.18.0 → 1.20.0\n- proxy-addr 2.0.7 → 2.0.8\n- brace-expansion 1.1.18 → 1.1.21, 2.1.4 → 2.1.7, 5.0.9 → 5.0.12\n\n## Override\n\n- shell-quote 1.9.0 → 1.11.0 via `overrides`; concurrently 9.2.4 pins\nshell-quote 1.9.0 exactly\n\n## Not fixable\n\nNo patched version is published yet:\n- braces 3.0.3 (GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm), dev only, via nodemon/chokidar and\nts-loader/micromatch\n- sprintf-js 1.0.3 (GHSA-hp3w-g68c-fv3c), dev only, via jest''s istanbul\nconfig loader\n\n## Verification\n\n`npm ci`, `npm install`, `npm run build` and `npm test` (unit: 196\ntests, integration: 25 tests) pass.\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1966821f8f5a66e8beba6f465759885855fa891","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-server-lib/git/trees/b1966821f8f5a66e8beba6f465759885855fa891"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-server-lib/git/commits/15a0c5e03a33384dd6fcb21816f68aff1aa2a999","verification":{"payload":"tree b1966821f8f5a66e8beba6f465759885855fa891\nparent e1a64285334107f9104ba899b09af1bccefd205d\nauthor Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com> 1791363445 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791363445 +0400\n\nfix(deps): resolve npm audit and Dependabot vulnerabilities (#378)\n\n## Summary\n\nResolves the fixable `npm audit` findings and Dependabot alerts.\n\n## Lockfile updates (`npm audit fix`)\n\n- axios 1.18.0 → 1.20.0\n- proxy-addr 2.0.7 → 2.0.8\n- brace-expansion 1.1.18 → 1.1.21, 2.1.4 → 2.1.7, 5.0.9 → 5.0.12\n\n## Override\n\n- shell-quote 1.9.0 → 1.11.0 via `overrides`; concurrently 9.2.4 pins\nshell-quote 1.9.0 exactly\n\n## Not fixable\n\nNo patched version is published yet:\n- braces 3.0.3 (GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm), dev only, via nodemon/chokidar and\nts-loader/micromatch\n- sprintf-js 1.0.3 (GHSA-hp3w-g68c-fv3c), dev only, via jest''s istanbul\nconfig loader\n\n## Verification\n\n`npm ci`, `npm install`, `npm run build` and `npm test` (unit: 196\ntests, integration: 25 tests) pass.\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxgl1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA60kQAApfS4x80FGoSvoHMmTqAODN\nN62q4iA4SST2r5LAMDTysPU08lCVnnFRfv1HOzGw3MNG2cSxRvGRQgNHy9FnrE9k\nRbtNQau83JAo6ITaktl6g0X79DmBzDAPe/86cGOMgBBoszEFZpL7gwve2x6E9D2J\nIpMigZraf6ajR73SyMS/DhPJDKSeTCNtuCN6hn2dyQgXTmdEAVYbb1cLSVOixxpG\nWsKE3BJkJcA0DrK42uPGkRmdv91NQ2Z8hfH/0OHWepmDWWr0m+SOrLl52Ox8htrh\nL0x7c8ZVt0jpqUIl+8EvcIJP299aTfQTLVRyBCjBRJXYNymkpx+Vn4firjdUm/RX\nFNpEx2B9Zk4NRVlh809lq+s0H8Ka4IhOnB3EuaUMVajwzZcCPGI0I76RlcuPujwc\nQbm59Yo1hvGgeDOHbwBALy1xo7fD3VH4QySf34Q6Htvxy09rwiX8b9S6XPHEbrW0\ngCbKQB7SShZI8Qpz/N01N65F0YbpxvegqfTDh8a+h6Ty/z8QnTVhoqJ7Zs1KxeYf\noEu7VLpjpyzU8fmFN20ehGTmYjhYmaD8SGC3wShBRco+SVOw7AUjsK0rOrpdiftU\nVMd3EXRVtq101qGESTa4dux0qj