nts","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-server-lib/commits/a95d2fa0094a4d963d4563f572bb4034364cb2ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T10:54:11Z","email":"gkrajniak@gmail.com","name":"Grzegorz Krajniak"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T10:54:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(env): expose VPN_CHECK_URL as vpnCheckUrl (#377)\n\n## What\n\nMap the `VPN_CHECK_URL` environment variable to the `vpnCheckUrl` key in\nthe client env config returned by `EnvService.getEnv()`.\n\n## Why\n\nThe VPN / network-visibility handling ported into\n`@openmfp/portal-ui-lib` reads the VPN reachability probe URL from `GET\n/rest/envconfig` as `vpnCheckUrl`. Surfacing it here lets every consumer\nconfigure the check via a backend environment variable instead of a\nhardcoded URL. When the variable is unset the value is an empty string\nand the feature stays off.\n\n## Testing\n\n- `npx jest src/env` — 33 tests pass; `env.service.ts` at 100%\nstatements/functions/lines.\n\nRelated to openmfp/portal-ui-lib#665\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"4406a0a00493b1053a80404390580aba3c6ff95b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-server-lib/git/trees/4406a0a00493b1053a80404390580aba3c6ff95b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-server-lib/git/commits/a95d2fa0094a4d963d4563f572bb4034364cb2ab","verification":{"payload":"tree 4406a0a00493b1053a80404390580aba3c6ff95b\nparent 8de49ccc90ad62f4820af3c432dc473eb6a8e7e4\nauthor Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com> 1790333651 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790333651 +0400\n\nfeat(env): expose VPN_CHECK_URL as vpnCheckUrl (#377)\n\n## What\n\nMap the `VPN_CHECK_URL` environment variable to the `vpnCheckUrl` key in\nthe client env config returned by `EnvService.getEnv()`.\n\n## Why\n\nThe VPN / network-visibility handling ported into\n`@openmfp/portal-ui-lib` reads the VPN reachability probe URL from `GET\n/rest/envconfig` as `vpnCheckUrl`. Surfacing it here lets every consumer\nconfigure the check via a backend environment variable instead of a\nhardcoded URL. When the variable is unset the value is an empty string\nand the feature stays off.\n\n## Testing\n\n- `npx jest src/env` — 33 tests pass; `env.service.ts` at 100%\nstatements/functions/lines.\n\nRelated to openmfp/portal-ui-lib#665\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtlLTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1SEQABnxpQWgFt9KWVBRUcYEZpMe\n4HNmEk8O78CFHBBn3tegIQVnT23jh/7DHo4qTBY4DYzWVouf3JaGzALGTZ7eAZh/\nNNQGL/jB5YyqK/Tor1/VclD+oi7aJfo0mhW7YWCy/5bveoBu/uXvSEcbrllGPd0/\nuFw+yao28WFx1A/jNdYiaEaFeo/7PCVnOM5WR9MZ8jUpJqo3YmWEc8iXHQlZKTdC\nmyB1rZvFrLf14e/jymbsAk5/63KFbHn4PufcokMmhL0o1CgnPrTHgj6FYOdqFIpM\nv0Xrxegt1BLTVWk5E8WCf1rbcpdk0rYheAB4jccBFDCfvXpQUNda9iI+GCCApGyQ\nZ/QPPvfVq9pKmoLilRiI0U5cWmv7cV83l2P2V3rqeEZ+85W38oGphn2YjvzyVQGF\n3Z17i15KRqtWoAh5lUO6rSoiYTGIXFAJF4q/pOV5/2u/o2M3nZkrC5iFw/eXtYRR\nK5VkutmJidyWkIOjnowplqpC7oqk9w8ZXB1wJeO2fcGh9JTn9IokUIe4TZ3ru8M5\n9N0tI//QpfZkgQ3cOF09fa8U9G8OTDpQaN0M1ucjy2BTqw9bnV9MUbZyYAkZhHTy\nMaYf7d+rYK1AsoivkUkuPHs1iVp9U6C04zbdcON/39Lw7fTSXSW0kjG/eK4G9fkT\n4o+emvFIsLY8SGFMdELN\n=x1l0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T10:54:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.githu