jniak","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-server-lib/commits/3eb586481792079c2a7b61091bf4a370b259e8e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T10:31:50Z","email":"gkrajniak@gmail.com","name":"Grzegorz Krajniak"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T10:31:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): resolve all npm audit vulnerabilities (#372)\n\nRun `npm audit fix` (safe) plus targeted forced upgrades to clear all 15\nreported advisories (2 critical, 7 high, 4 moderate, 2 low) down to 0.\n\nAll affected packages were dev-only (transitive test/build tooling); the\nproduction dependency tree (`npm audit --omit=dev`) was already clean,\nso published consumers of the library were never exposed.\n\nDirect dev-dependency bumps:\n- concurrently 9.2.1 -> ^9.2.4  (pulls patched shell-quote, critical)\n- jest-junit   16.0.0 -> ^17.0.0 (pulls patched uuid, moderate)\n\nRemaining fixes (axios, body-parser, brace-expansion, fast-uri,\nform-data, joi, js-yaml, multer, qs, @babel/core) were transitive and\nresolved via the refreshed lockfile.\n\nVerified: `npm audit` = 0 vulnerabilities, `nest build` succeeds, and\nthe full test suite (35 suites, 23 tests) passes.\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"b521e9ff716491beeba08210a8d52f3198463070","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-server-lib/git/trees/b521e9ff716491beeba08210a8d52f3198463070"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-server-lib/git/commits/3eb586481792079c2a7b61091bf4a370b259e8e1","verification":{"payload":"tree b521e9ff716491beeba08210a8d52f3198463070\nparent 8509bb6f8302205df4995f05af0952f396c077b3\nauthor Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com> 1786703510 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786703510 +0400\n\nfix(deps): resolve all npm audit vulnerabilities (#372)\n\nRun `npm audit fix` (safe) plus targeted forced upgrades to clear all 15\nreported advisories (2 critical, 7 high, 4 moderate, 2 low) down to 0.\n\nAll affected packages were dev-only (transitive test/build tooling); the\nproduction dependency tree (`npm audit --omit=dev`) was already clean,\nso published consumers of the library were never exposed.\n\nDirect dev-dependency bumps:\n- concurrently 9.2.1 -> ^9.2.4  (pulls patched shell-quote, critical)\n- jest-junit   16.0.0 -> ^17.0.0 (pulls patched uuid, moderate)\n\nRemaining fixes (axios, body-parser, brace-expansion, fast-uri,\nform-data, joi, js-yaml, multer, qs, @babel/core) were transitive and\nresolved via the refreshed lockfile.\n\nVerified: `npm audit` = 0 vulnerabilities, `nest build` succeeds, and\nthe full test suite (35 suites, 23 tests) passes.\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfu6WCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApR4QAE1qiL0/8jw6kEdr4G8YGTtH\nxGLn/PyNBe7PmrSfMpshhddY93ukzHh2i2SPBK3+Oyt6ff3FaxLpHLn9F24CPIJA\nWM52TQDXagySb7T+bsAhbDCNqneuwn45sGv4fF8pVHd4HrIxqAUZxQnut5PX8dLz\nozgHeksp50cbPYMm4xO0dgoJGyRzWSKA5xn13sSX3GGor5XEEolb5rOv1ip8bQgT\nynCC1BnV8Hppc+SmZwSqWzVjh4payGgTEUsrQTeuY/cWZKkOaMwRHDJQpeLitArx\nRONIhd1H5uWeDF9A9KBHo1ungJ1QtsifCtZJEy1UBP6G7618IyT/hrjpvw82Ddu6\nr8gh72Kxm84dQtAUXqhSUNBODDPYnE6AHnuqf3ibhTPzqHqukGjg+T3eZiQn/ZIe\nKhf1CFpY5OkQs+lZya5nCHyhK2N+9jhiVWNSPNT1UIktg++D+QHSThW0UOT2Xjp2\n1WyYa64u5lHh2quSchc7QMkeJf2ypaMGLrFksY3CfA6DEDrbPSq7iq4PY80Ff80z\nXNaNVB0YlnYcH8EJyPYgzP86b9NJfUxjZm/Se0J1lghM2e6zllIplpulv2r6c0Bp\n2+MovENyAfiSrz4PnC2uMQqxVXu6tJF+OfDwjIljRFQnU9E82MTgErEQ9+I52M48\n0h+42Z0EgRCC+wRtcBC+\n=CDNG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-14T10:32:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"htt