D`\n-\n[#&#8203;2644](https://redirect.github.com/validatorjs/validator.js/pull/2644)\nimprove `pt-BR` locale by adding support for alphanumeric CNPJ format\n[@&#8203;easedu](https://redirect.github.com/easedu)\n-\n[#&#8203;2675](https://redirect.github.com/validatorjs/validator.js/pull/2675)\nimprove `pt-BR` locale by adding support for formatted CPF values\n[@&#8203;easedu](https://redirect.github.com/easedu)\n-\n[#&#8203;2643](https://redirect.github.com/validatorjs/validator.js/pull/2643)\n`isPassportNumber`: improve `MX` locale\n[@&#8203;jesroffrouk](https://redirect.github.com/jesroffrouk)\n-\n[#&#8203;2676](https://redirect.github.com/validatorjs/validator.js/pull/2676)\n`isMobilePhone`: add `fr-DJ` locale\n[@&#8203;Kartikeya-guthub](https://redirect.github.com/Kartikeya-guthub)\n-\n[#&#8203;2682](https://redirect.github.com/validatorjs/validator.js/pull/2682)\n`isPostalCode`: add `MC` locale\n[@&#8203;moogblob](https://redirect.github.com/moogblob)\n-\n[#&#8203;2690](https://redirect.github.com/validatorjs/validator.js/pull/2690)\n`isJSON`: allow any valid JSON value to pass\n[@&#8203;relu91](https://redirect.github.com/relu91)\n-\n[#&#8203;2693](https://redirect.github.com/validatorjs/validator.js/pull/2693)\n`isSlug`: restrict allowed characters to valid slug charset\n[@&#8203;Shrawak](https://redirect.github.com/Shrawak)\n- **Doc fixes and others:**\n-\n[#&#8203;2658](https://redirect.github.com/validatorjs/validator.js/pull/2658)\n[@&#8203;Manaskarthik28](https://redirect.github.com/Manaskarthik28)\n-\n[#&#8203;2592](https://redirect.github.com/validatorjs/validator.js/pull/2592)\n[@&#8203;noritaka1166](https://redirect.github.com/noritaka1166)\n-\n[#&#8203;2591](https://redirect.github.com/validatorjs/validator.js/pull/2591)\n[@&#8203;noritaka1166](https://redirect.github.com/noritaka1166)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is behind base branch, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won''t be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/openmfp/portal-server-lib).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0My4yODAuMCIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQzLjI4MC4wIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6W119-->\n\nSigned-off-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqafijCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADZQQAGbtxtgKePVv8DySYprFG4Pw\n3y9Uv9VgyrE4FfrTGZVQRdLi90ViWsmab9UT6RencoDagY3HLSkPWqzPRSCvcV3H\nc9nEww9eYALajPIQt+rUk+BJto6bZW0s7WdrVWyPl43osoofwVHR9UE24rZhRyZA\n8syRewM1UbB+P/uWVpDX7jsQEmv6v0LVCf+DtTN1NNdT0INUvNzkY7T2O8utqIeB\ns380Z9Yff1L8pi5Sd415jNTjcJkDAHMxVa8xsGgy/Xyy2nshxqmq7iU3XLOSnv6o\nWP1HhLO+OSZ/j35yHsqmYgljsBzuX9O78S5GuZTZsV8NNIWk+zVlFye+6bSq8uCS\nRmEhtZ4V605xp9lcUBxRLwLLa2kF7DbT0g8EJ9pCqNR5L82PKy6h4c9scXhAHgWj\nY/MQY97WI7fHD4CGgalgOR8pjTgvdn/2fL78aQVkbSyguGW5bxsW4iR11+7eI3gZ\nWRzvJ3dRvDHRS4o4iH7YGbBLIac6Gkq/5j5D1ntygd4O/7VsHa3JfjuiOiHnfRJU\nsUVZDhx1bWXDRIBzsamgZHP63ucD/5lpy4ckTbpzxtt8uqqLldPF4Mn0+3bObxFz\nyUooGKgvXkPHpfGM/dVnwWJ7AwjK4stgpw9B4ZF/vIbMICvQ3duiHz+E2qdDm20I\nDPxm6pQxadIGpud9y7yE\n=V54c\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-29T12:57:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":