pi.github.com/users/renovate%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal-server-lib/commits/7b120dce3c2b804051a3e3588534bc413a35915d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-19T07:26:42Z","email":"29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"renovate[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-19T07:26:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Update NestJS (#331)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change |\n[Age](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n[Confidence](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [@nestjs/cli](https://redirect.github.com/nestjs/nest-cli) |\n[`11.0.14` →\n`11.0.16`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/@nestjs%2fcli/11.0.14/11.0.16)\n|\n![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/npm/@nestjs%2fcli/11.0.16?slim=true)\n|\n![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/npm/@nestjs%2fcli/11.0.14/11.0.16?slim=true)\n|\n| [@nestjs/testing](https://nestjs.com)\n([source](https://redirect.github.com/nestjs/nest/tree/HEAD/packages/testing))\n| [`11.1.9` →\n`11.1.14`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/@nestjs%2ftesting/11.1.9/11.1.14)\n|\n![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/npm/@nestjs%2ftesting/11.1.14?slim=true)\n|\n![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/npm/@nestjs%2ftesting/11.1.9/11.1.14?slim=true)\n|\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>nestjs/nest-cli (@&#8203;nestjs/cli)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v11.0.16`](https://redirect.github.com/nestjs/nest-cli/releases/tag/11.0.16)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/nestjs/nest-cli/compare/11.0.15...11.0.16)\n\n- Merge pull request\n[#&#8203;3246](https://redirect.github.com/nestjs/nest-cli/issues/3246)\nfrom nestjs/revert-3183-renovate/inquirer-prompts-8.x\n([`a93d919`](https://redirect.github.com/nestjs/nest-cli/commit/a93d9193))\n- Revert \"fix(deps): up