enmfp/portal-server-lib/commits/3df5f19fd7ef8e5aba8c1edb64449aa3f6c8d4ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-17T09:09:06Z","email":"29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"renovate[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-17T09:09:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Update NestJS (#313)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change | Age | Confidence |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [@nestjs/common](https://nestjs.com)\n([source](https://redirect.github.com/nestjs/nest/tree/HEAD/packages/common))\n| [`11.1.8` ->\n`11.1.9`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/@nestjs%2fcommon/11.1.8/11.1.9)\n|\n[![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/npm/@nestjs%2fcommon/11.1.9?slim=true)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/)\n|\n[![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/npm/@nestjs%2fcommon/11.1.8/11.1.9?slim=true)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/)\n|\n| [@nestjs/core](https://nestjs.com)\n([source](https://redirect.github.com/nestjs/nest/tree/HEAD/packages/core))\n| [`11.1.8` ->\n`11.1.9`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/@nestjs%2fcore/11.1.8/11.1.9)\n|\n[![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/npm/@nestjs%2fcore/11.1.9?slim=true)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/)\n|\n[![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/npm/@nestjs%2fcore/11.1.8/11.1.9?slim=true)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/)\n|\n| [@nestjs/platform-express](https://nestjs.com)\n([source](https://redirect.github.com/nestjs/nest/tree/HEAD/packages/platform-express))\n| [`11.1.8` ->\n`11.1.9`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/@nestjs%2fplatform-express/11.1.8/11.1.9)\n|\n[![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/npm/@nestjs%2fplatform-express/11.1.9?slim=true)](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/)\n|\n[![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/npm/@nestjs%2fplatform-express/11.1.8