unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90477293?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eduardohr-muniz","id":90477293,"login":"eduardohr-muniz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNDc3Mjkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eduardohr-muniz/go_router_modular/commit/3d051e3a74ba2e6dec02027c6ec27698dbecb7db","node_id":"C_kwDOL9LLJ9oAKDNkMDUxZTNhNzRiYTJlNmRlYzAyMDI3YzZlYzI3Njk4ZGJlY2I3ZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eduardohr-muniz/go_router_modular/commit/89bcf59e078fc58001bf9c2becde7ed6a032c11f","sha":"89bcf59e078fc58001bf9c2becde7ed6a032c11f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eduardohr-muniz/go_router_modular/commits/89bcf59e078fc58001bf9c2becde7ed6a032c11f"}],"sha":"3d051e3a74ba2e6dec02027c6ec27698dbecb7db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eduardohr-muniz/go_router_modular/commits/3d051e3a74ba2e6dec02027c6ec27698dbecb7db"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90477293?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eduardohr-muniz","id":90477293,"login":"eduardohr-muniz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNDc3Mjkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eduardohr-muniz/go_router_modular/commits/89bcf59e078fc58001bf9c2becde7ed6a032c11f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T01:24:06Z","email":"90477293+eduardohr-muniz@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eduardo Muniz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T01:24:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Resolve depency ghost (#19)\n\n* first commit\n\n* Refactor BindLocator and Bind classes to improve type compatibility checks and eliminate phantom instances during factory lookups. Updated the compatibility search to use Dart''s reified generics, ensuring that interface resolutions do not invoke factory functions unnecessarily. Enhanced tests to validate the new behavior, ensuring no breaking changes for untyped factory lookups while maintaining singleton identity and performance optimizations.\n\n* Add documentation for DI package refactoring plan\n\n- Introduced a comprehensive refactoring document outlining the current state, identified issues, and an incremental roadmap for extracting the dependency injection (DI) engine into a standalone package.\n- Document includes a detailed diagnosis of existing problems, architectural vision for the new structure, and suggestions for improvements to enhance maintainability and performance.\n- Key issues addressed include strong coupling between DI and routing, multiple tracking structures for search protection, and the need for clearer type handling in bindings.\n\n* Refactor InjectionManager and routing components to enhance validation and instantiation logic. Introduced OnceBuilder for caching widget builds to prevent unnecessary re-instantiations during hot-reloads. Updated ParentWidgetObserver to support childBuilder for improved performance. Added comprehensive tests to ensure correct behavior and prevent regressions in factory bind handling.\n\n* feat: add copyWith support to GoRouter configuration for flexible parameter overrides\n\n* docs: add guide for overriding router options and update package dependencies","tree":{"sha":"776d3a18208c007cada6132c4bb0d747e8f107fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eduardohr-muniz/go_router_modular/git/trees/776d3a18208c007cada6132c4bb0d747e8f107fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eduardohr-muniz/go_router_modular/git/commits/89bcf59e078fc58001bf9c2becde7ed6a032c11f","verification":{"payload":"tree 776d3a18208c007cada6132c4bb0d747e8f107fc\nparent d0ad054dbd946c045162b11413d4045c1274fa86\nauthor Eduardo Muniz <90477293+eduardohr-muniz@users.noreply.github.com> 1782437046 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782437046 -0300\n\nResolve depency ghost (#19)\n\n* first commit\n\n* Refactor BindLocator and Bind classes to improve type compatibility checks and eliminate phantom instances during factory lookups. Updated the compatibility search to use Dart''s reified generics, ensuring that interface resolutions do not invoke factory functions unnecessarily. Enhanced tests to validate the new behavior, ensuring no breaking changes for untyped factory lookups while maintaining singleton identity and performance optimizations.\n\n* Add documentation for DI package refactoring plan\n\n- Introduced a comprehensive refactoring document outlining the current state, identified issues, and an incremental roadmap for extracting the dependency injection (DI) engine into a standalone package.\n- Document includes a detailed diagnosis of existing problems, architectural vision for the new structure, and suggestions for improvements to enhance maintainability and performance.\n- Key issues addressed include strong coupling between DI and routing, multiple tracking structures for search protection, and the need for clearer type handling in bindings.\n\n* Refactor InjectionManager and routing components to enhance validation and instantiation logic. Introduced OnceBuilder for caching widget builds to prevent unnecessary re-instantiations during hot-reloads. Updated ParentWidgetObserver to support childBuilder for improved performance. Added comprehensive tests to ensure correct behavior and prevent regressions in factory bind handling.\n\n* feat: add copyWith support to GoRouter configuration for flexible parameter overrides\n\n* docs: add guide for overriding router options and update package dependencies","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPdS2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAz9UQABmNNBta+uwpbCeU2j/cb9i4\nIcIu5te9mikSAgDIaGeGmBa0TUFNsaTujYMEE74Aqzxr41+KFc+VL2DQRdGdvlrq\neD6reqngtJe7eAa+z1x71flNpGccE2XbnwwoGnuMZGu1uo4JBOEXXYJ8RkEdAV0T\n1eR3KGZxK2rNQw3kQCclkUfN9dRkQlh+AvbktYotc0glzikoMgEBWoL1aDSfohpH\nXnplfoGTZdGhnquA5I5Bc8LtnjbylleWzsqN6wg7z68pKXlXp6rluw3C9u1El/qX\nib6Uvs9FxsWheCE7ZGGRCkikEQf7hUJvki9vY+fL9prwqzwtP53xWHjGmQ/pLDBM\nE5TSFYtIh6U+CLlu72y7JYvk25XQduSeFMpYM6sBxO4O28bTBrxqVxu4qGuSdCmQ\n2i43tX9wIuG2FH3P9aPc2I8xVAbqKTqGR61za+NWYSpcqBiI9ctJ8n8gf356u2rJ\nEGQxS8U9htaI/s145iK/h6VIPDIjqNfrUSa3FlMHfqrVPFaoQmyAlbFMiwlVLDFO\n0CZjS/OZcES9wQvgCv390yUq00MSN5WNU4tfMuPXudWnFcOtFPPMv6jmhg0ZvPyJ\nPLn7xHUE905sLSA/ne04jQ6Y+tXJai9ikDmiVaeV1dzemWUEvznzdDGiSgJYx+6w\nB0gdGKU76nxvb/9gsMyb\n=dLO+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true