:false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eduardohr-muniz/go_router_modular/commit/6929fce8b8801110b856b6f752db4a0144ffd605","node_id":"C_kwDOL9LLJ9oAKDY5MjlmY2U4Yjg4MDExMTBiODU2YjZmNzUyZGI0YTAxNDRmZmQ2MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eduardohr-muniz/go_router_modular/commit/483c592212f537644937f2e1b19a9df2e04b5f47","sha":"483c592212f537644937f2e1b19a9df2e04b5f47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eduardohr-muniz/go_router_modular/commits/483c592212f537644937f2e1b19a9df2e04b5f47"}],"sha":"6929fce8b8801110b856b6f752db4a0144ffd605","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eduardohr-muniz/go_router_modular/commits/6929fce8b8801110b856b6f752db4a0144ffd605"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90477293?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eduardohr-muniz","id":90477293,"login":"eduardohr-muniz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNDc3Mjkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardohr-muniz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eduardohr-muniz/go_router_modular/commits/483c592212f537644937f2e1b19a9df2e04b5f47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T20:10:10Z","email":"90477293+eduardohr-muniz@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eduardo Muniz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T20:10:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Ajustes (#18)\n\n* Update dependencies in pubspec.lock, refactor routing structure to use ModuleBranch for cleaner route management, and enhance BindRegistry with improved type registration methods. Additionally, update documentation to reflect changes in routing and branch handling.\n\n* Update pubspec.lock to version 5.1.0, modify import in go_router_modular.dart to hide GoTransition, and add go_transitions import in child_route.dart for enhanced routing capabilities.\n\n* Enhance StatefulShellModularRoute with animated branch transitions and custom navigator container support. Introduced StatefulShellBranchTransitions for smoother navigation between branches, allowing for customizable transitions. Updated routing structure to improve state management and documentation to reflect new features and usage examples.\n\n* Enhance dependency injection with improved batch registration and singleton management. Reworked `registerBatch` and `commitBatch` to ensure proper resolution of typed binds and prevent multiple instantiations. Introduced new tests to validate singleton behavior and lazy loading semantics. Updated CHANGELOG to reflect these changes.\n\n* Refactor dependency injection to improve singleton management and type resolution. Enhanced `registerBatch` and `commitBatch` methods to ensure correct handling of keyed and unkeyed binds, preventing multiple instantiations. Added regression tests for interface resolution and keyed/unkeyed singleton behavior. Updated CHANGELOG to reflect these changes.\n\n* Refactor dependency injection to enhance singleton identity preservation and resolve concurrency issues. Centralized dual-map invariant handling, improved error logging during registration, and updated compatibility search to prevent `ConcurrentModificationError`. Added regression tests for singleton behavior and interface resolution. Updated CHANGELOG to reflect these changes.\n\n* Enhance dependency injection to handle self-referential factory bindings and prevent infinite loops during resolution. Introduced mechanisms to skip currently executing binds, improving compatibility search. Updated tests to cover new behavior for interface resolution and singleton management. Updated CHANGELOG to reflect these changes.","tree":{"sha":"575da359f3d96674b8640e798139b30fd334ec5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eduardohr-muniz/go_router_modular/git/trees/575da359f3d96674b8640e798139b30fd334ec5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eduardohr-muniz/go_router_modular/git/commits/483c592212f537644937f2e1b19a9df2e04b5f47","verification":{"payload":"tree 575da359f3d96674b8640e798139b30fd334ec5b\nparent a884ff82602f177e68e8d7870fd60a2c08fdff77\nauthor Eduardo Muniz <90477293+eduardohr-muniz@users.noreply.github.com> 1779048610 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779048610 -0300\n\nAjustes (#18)\n\n* Update dependencies in pubspec.lock, refactor routing structure to use ModuleBranch for cleaner route management, and enhance BindRegistry with improved type registration methods. Additionally, update documentation to reflect changes in routing and branch handling.\n\n* Update pubspec.lock to version 5.1.0, modify import in go_router_modular.dart to hide GoTransition, and add go_transitions import in child_route.dart for enhanced routing capabilities.\n\n* Enhance StatefulShellModularRoute with animated branch transitions and custom navigator container support. Introduced StatefulShellBranchTransitions for smoother navigation between branches, allowing for customizable transitions. Updated routing structure to improve state management and documentation to reflect new features and usage examples.\n\n* Enhance dependency injection with improved batch registration and singleton management. Reworked `registerBatch` and `commitBatch` to ensure proper resolution of typed binds and prevent multiple instantiations. Introduced new tests to validate singleton behavior and lazy loading semantics. Updated CHANGELOG to reflect these changes.\n\n* Refactor dependency injection to improve singleton management and type resolution. Enhanced `registerBatch` and `commitBatch` methods to ensure correct handling of keyed and unkeyed binds, preventing multiple instantiations. Added regression tests for interface resolution and keyed/unkeyed singleton behavior. Updated CHANGELOG to reflect these changes.\n\n* Refactor dependency injection to enhance singleton identity preservation and resolve concurrency issues. Centralized dual-map invariant handling, improved error logging during registration, and updated compatibility search to prevent `ConcurrentModificationError`. Added regression tests for singleton behavior and interface resolution. Updated CHANGELOG to reflect these changes.\n\n* Enhance dependency injection to handle self-referential factory bindings and prevent infinite loops during resolution. Introduced mechanisms to skip currently executing binds, improving compatibility search. Updated tests to cover new behavior for interface resolution and singleton management. Updated CHANGELOG to reflect these changes.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqCiCiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkzEQAGIgfU4M+UHLVxK9I+44WAcl\nLFc6NcKkDBDk4ex9v06zxZN3X5iP/BemxOP7wIKh24mIvp6d1p7Jnf29+1mjxmRg\nuzhTyQz2s70YrL5igAU41JMJ4cHe2NOmOQo6fjnoB7PBds91j3RharcAlA2LHwgH\ndibdSBDnet7yNdNRY4Hn3wtiSAt8XoPBVup7fAX+2vo/M7o1N9tij+8eOGn6zeUx\nCpUqwgmvFyG4OA4QWphg0ZN1Stx/j9kDSd9lxzLEPsRiUWoYEYghsNLd379LwTZ6\nbtkCklxdcBbtwg7bXXt6MRE/mYQ1EDS0f19ZfHaIcnrUxIYlHieuK7ZG8ai1CHlC\nlgJwkwAHbW8yUUucgcG1ewavy7h9XiiPjJtmpBfyfUeXdqjusC6FVeOGyn8EoJ75\nUPMklrZ9d2bDQlcGxnu+jrkSJ1amMAtBvAJwn1